Package: icjr
Title: Repeated Elastic-Net Feature Selection Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Isaac",
      family = "Jenkins",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "ijenkins@fredhutch.org"
    )
Description: Tools for repeated cross-validated elastic-net modeling of
    high-dimensional feature matrices with Gaussian, binomial, Poisson, and
    Cox outcomes. The package supports unpenalized adjustment covariates,
    configurable feature filtering, and feature-selection stability summaries.
